{{!-- A SEASON'S "+ ADD" SLOT: the last item in its list of cards, where an entry written into this
      season lands (addEntry appends). Shown on hover or focus of its season (or its thread's cell on
      the aggregate), and always on a touch screen and in the clock's ghost season. It keeps its
      room while hidden, so revealing it never moves a card.

      Glyph AND word: a reader on a magnifier must not have to guess what a bare "+" adds.

      `data-season`/`data-year`/`data-year-only` are the date the entry dialog opens on; the lane's
      `data-track-id` (or the window's own thread) is where it is written.

      Context: an `add` view-model (timeline-view.js#addSlotVM). --}}
<li class="stonetop-timeline-add-slot{{#if ghost}} stonetop-timeline-add-slot--ghost{{/if}}">
	<button type="button" class="stonetop-timeline-add"
	        data-season="{{this.season}}" data-year="{{this.year}}" data-year-only="{{this.yearOnly}}"
	        data-timeline-focus="add-{{this.key}}{{#if trackId}}-{{this.trackId}}{{/if}}"
	        aria-label="{{this.label}}" data-tooltip="{{this.label}}">
		<i class="fas fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i>
		<span>{{localize "stonetop.timeline.addShort"}}</span>
	</button>
</li>
